      "id": "C04-01",
      "subtitles_zh": "路线先决定去哪里，再影响什么时候能到。下令前，地图显示“预期抵达时间”；下令后，军队窗口显示当前剩余时间。真正到场还要看实际位置、状态和剩余路线。看到一个日期，不能直接当成已经抵达。",
      "subtitles_en": "A route determines where an army goes, then affects when it can arrive. Before the order, the map shows “Predicted arrival.” Afterward, the army window shows the current time remaining. Actual arrival still requires checking location, state, and the remaining route. A displayed date does not mean the army is already there.",
