    {
      "id": "C04-03",
      "subtitles_zh": "四十三天与三十天描述的行程范围不同。不能拿首段三十天，说整支军队三十天就到利雪；也不能只因为两个数不同，就判定界面或读取出错。把整条估计与当前首段分开保留，真实抵达再核对。两数相减也不会自动得到精确的后续路程时长。",
      "subtitles_en": "Those 43 days and 30 days describe different parts of the journey. We cannot use the first leg's 30 days to claim the whole army will reach Lisieux in 30 days. Their difference alone does not establish an error in either reading. Keep the whole-route estimate and the first-leg time separate, then check actual arrival. Subtracting them does not automatically give the exact duration of the later legs.",
      "chapter_start_sample": 950976,
      "chapter_end_sample": 1559232,
      "chapter_start_seconds": 39.624,
      "chapter_end_seconds": 64.968,
