      "id": "C04-06",
      "subtitles_zh": "原生概念用一半进度说明锁定。这个超过一半的实际样本，可以证明当时已经锁定，却不能替代正好百分之五十的边界实验。画面没有单独告诉我们取消移动的精确边界，所以先讲当时锁定，刚好一半仍留给实际测试。",
      "subtitles_en": "The Chinese game concept describes the lock at halfway. This actual sample beyond halfway shows the army was locked then, but does not replace a test at exactly 50%. The image alone does not give us the exact boundary for cancelling movement. We can explain the observed lock; exactly halfway still needs an actual test.",
