      "id": "C04-07",
      "subtitles_zh": "锁定之后按“停止移动”，要看当前路段和后续路线的区别。条件允许时，可以停在当前地点，也可以保留正在走的第一段、撤掉后面的路；只剩一段等情况还可能拒绝。按钮提交成功，不等于已经原地停止。",
      "subtitles_en": "After movement locks, “Halt movement” needs a check of the current leg versus the later route. When conditions allow, the army may stop at its current location, or keep the active first leg and remove the rest. Cases such as only one leg remaining may be refused. A successful button submission does not mean the army has stopped in place.",
