    {
      "id": "C04-09",
      "subtitles_zh": "下令前的警告也有自己的范围。“会支付登船费”说的是当前路线预计包含支付事件，不是钱已经扣了。县域预算二百三十六，也不是每经过一个省就必定扣二百三十六。规划提示、动作后的状态和实际结算要分别记。",
      "subtitles_en": "Pre-order warnings also have their own scope. “Will pay embarkation fees” says the current route is expected to include a payment event, not that gold has already been deducted. A county-entry budget of 236 does not mean every province crossed must cost 236 soldiers. Record planning warnings, the state after the order, and actual settlement separately.",
