    {
      "id": "C04-10",
      "subtitles_zh": "这轮行军后来还核到了登船和登陆窗口。相对一月二十日起点，第三十到三十二日进入海段、变成已登船；第四十二到四十四日抵达陆地，路线走完、回到普通状态。两窗完整二十七团都仍是六千六百七十九，库存也没变。这只说明各自前后净变化；登陆后补员条件已经变化，后续要重新建立基线。",
      "subtitles_en": "This journey later gave us boarding and landing windows. From day 30 to day 32 after the January 20 start, the army entered the sea leg and became embarked. From day 42 to day 44, it reached land, completed the route, and returned to a regular state. All 27 regiments stayed at a total of 6,679 soldiers in both windows, with supply unchanged. That describes each window's net change. Reinforcement conditions changed after landing, so later observations need a new baseline.",
